DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261129T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261129T193000
SUMMARY:Joie Bianco Trio
LOCATION:Birdland Jazz Club\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Joie Bianco is a 24-year-old jazz singer\, teacher\, and arrang
 
er from Staten Island\, New York. She is known for her sweet yet warm tone\
 
, reminiscent of jazz greats like Ella Fitzgerald and Dinah Washington. Joi
 
e draws inspiration from across the musical spectrum\, from the elegance of
 
 Nat King Cole and the swing of Roy Eldridge to the spirit of Sister Rosett
 
a Tharpe and the soul of James Brown. A graduate of the University of Miami
 
s Frost School of Music\, Bianco has collaborated with many jazz luminaries
 
\, including Marilyn Maye\, Jane Monheit\, Cyrille Aime\, and Joey Calderaz
 
zo. Additionally\, she has worked with other respected New York musicians l
 
ike Emmet Cohen\, Bryan Carter\, Peter Bernstein\, Benny Benack III\, and m
 
ore.She has appeared in many of NYCs renowned jazz and cabaret clubs\, incl
 
uding Jazz at Lincoln Center\, Carnegie Hall\, Birdland\, and The Django. J
 
oie has also performed at various venues across Texas\, such as Monks Jazz\
 
, Jazz Texas\, and Parker Jazz Club. While Joie loves performing solo\, she
 
 can often be found singing around the city with her vocal trio\, The Sunho
 
use Singers. This versatile groupfeaturing jazz vocalists Kate Kortum\, Jun
 
e Cavlan\, and Joie Biancohas performed at venues such as Birdland\, Chris 
 
Jazz Caf\, Zinc Bar\, Mezzrow\, Smalls\, and The Django\, and will appear a
 
t Jazz at Lincoln Centers Appel Room this January alongside Ekep Nkwelle an
 
d Luther Allison. Joies accolades include winning the 2019 YoungArts award 
 
in jazz vocals and the 2023 DownBeat Student Music Award for Best Solo Jazz
 
 Vocalist. Described by The New York Times Stephen Holden as a prodigious d
 
iscovery\, she is steadily carving out her place as a young voice in New Yo
 
rks jazz scene. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/joie-bianco
 
-trio-birdland-jazz-club-tickets/15007273
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/joie-bianco-trio-birdland-jazz-club-tic
 
kets/15007273
END:VEVENT
